   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Logo proposal from Mercedes-Benz Tech Innovation GmbH for the Eclipse OpenSOVD project. Partly based on ideas of Wasilios Gaitanidis und Thilo Schmitt.</rdf:li>
